# Upgrade planning docs

When changing plan or architecture:

- Keep [STATUS.md](docs/upgrade/STATUS.md) in sync—**Last updated**, phase/sub-phase, next up, blockers, A1 audit table
- Final decisions go in [DECISIONS.md](docs/upgrade/DECISIONS.md); open questions in its table until resolved
- [PLAN.md](docs/upgrade/PLAN.md) changes are rare; note why in DECISIONS or STATUS session log
- Baseline counts live in [baseline/](docs/upgrade/baseline/)—reference file name in STATUS
- Write for a future Cursor session with **no chat memory**

Use checklist `- [ ]` / `- [x]` in STATUS for phase progress.

**Do not** reintroduce strangler-plan content (`Scholar::Record`, Phase 0–6 export/import strangler).

**Terminology:** use **upgrade** (not modernization) in new doc text. Branch name `scholar-modernization` is unchanged.
